title: faster search
pid: 7ee12ce8-3c47-4388-829b-09cd6c5c52d4
body: |2-
  - An option for 'only if it matches everything'.
  - A limit on the number of words matched.
  - Let C-c G RET cancel the enrichment.
  - When searching buffer text, permit skipping metadata,
    or focusing exclusively on metadata.
